e demands, to operations and business intelligence. Using AWS, the company built a serverless, business-to-business iGaming platform that can deliver a personalized and responsible experience for players. Since its inception, The Mill Adventure is on track to double its customer base year-on-year and has reduced the time it usually takes to onboard customers from months to weeks. Innovation happens quickly at the company with over 10,000 product updates released in just 3 years.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/the-mill-adventure-logo%401x.8f22709d1e655633f4295f2d29d958a29e399323.png","displayLocation":"Malta","customerNameLower":"the mill adventure","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2023-05-22","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/the-mill-adventure/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"The Mill Adventure","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"The Mill Adventure Delivers Personalized iGaming Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#malta","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Malta","description":"Malta","dateCreated":"2020-04-09T03:37:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-