ry#next-gen-infrastructure","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Next Gen Infrastructure","description":"\u003cp\u003eNext-gen MSPs are building long-term and sustainable managed services solutions for their customers across the full engagement lifecycle\u0026mdash;from planning and deployment to ongoing operations and optimization.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:21:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:21:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Cost Management","description":"Cost Management","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-15T01:16:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#business-outcome#cost-optimization","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#business-outcome","name":"cost-optimization","description":"Cost Optimization","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2019-07-22T18:39:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#digital-virgo","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"digital-virgo","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-21T00:20:56+0000","additionalFields":{"videoSrcUrl":"https://youtu.be/IV-yIyzKlkY","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eDigital Virgo est une entreprise sp\u0026eacute;cialis\u0026eacute;e dans le paiement mobile et le marketing digital. Tiers de confiance entre les op\u0026eacute;rateurs t\u0026eacute;l\u0026eacute;phoniques et les fournisseurs de contenus payants. Digital Virgo a migr\u0026eacute; vers AWS en 2016, depuis lors, ils ont acquis plusieurs entreprises et migr\u0026eacute; leur infrastructure vers le cloud. Fin 2022, Digital Virgo \u0026agrave; demand\u0026eacute; le soutien d\u0026rsquo;AWS Enterprise Support pour la diffusion de l\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;v\u0026eacute;nement de la Coupe du monde de football. La Coupe du Monde est un \u0026eacute;norme \u0026eacute;v\u0026eacute;nement pour Digital Virgo, avec l\u0026rsquo;aide d\u0026rsquo;Entreprise Support, ils ont pu se pr\u0026eacute;parer \u0026agrave; cet \u0026eacute;v\u0026eacute;nement. Depuis leur migration, Digital Virgo n\u0026rsquo;a connu aucun temps d\u0026rsquo;arr\u0026ecirc;t.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/digital-virgo-logo.8519b8390bac904f07c00bb7c5b3cb0d09f18074.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"digital virgo","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Logiciels et Internet","sortDate":"2023-04-24","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/digital-virgo/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Digital Virgo","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"TÃ©moignages clients","headline":"Digital Virgo avec le Cloud AWS comme support central d’infrastructure pour la Coupe du Monde de football"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#france","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"France","description":"France","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:48+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","description":"Mid-Market","dateCreated":"201