:18:06+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAVSimulation, co-entreprise Sogeclair, Dassault Syst\u0026egrave;mes, UTAC et Renault, con\u0026ccedil;oit, vend et maintient une large gamme de logiciels et de solutions de simulation automobile. AVSimulation aide les acteurs de la mobilit\u0026eacute; intelligente \u0026agrave; r\u0026eacute;duire leur Time-To-Market et les co\u0026ucirc;ts de d\u0026eacute;veloppement en r\u0026eacute;duisant les nombres de prototypes et les essais physiques gr\u0026acirc;ce \u0026agrave; la simulation. En 2021, AVSimulation a choisi de travailler avec VISEO et AWS, dans le but de d\u0026eacute;velopper son offre via la plateforme de calcul massif Web-based SCANeR Cloud.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/avsimulation%20-%20logo.3508198101300735b09d3e0a4952cf6ccfba4c87.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"avsimulation","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Logiciels et Internet","sortDate":"2023-04-12","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/avsimulation/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"AVSimulation","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"VISEO embarque AVSimulation sur le cloud AWS pour des capacités de simulation automobile augmentées"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eventbridge","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EventBridge","description":"Amazon EventBridge","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","descri