 fa\u0026ccedil;on dont les risques climatiques \u0026eacute;volueront localement \u0026agrave; un horizon de plusieurs dizaines d\u0026rsquo;ann\u0026eacute;es. Pour ce faire, elle agr\u0026egrave;ge, traite et rend accessibles les donn\u0026eacute;es de simulations climatiques mondiales gr\u0026acirc;ce \u0026agrave; une infrastructure HPC h\u0026eacute;berg\u0026eacute;e dans le cloud AWS.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/tcdf%20-%20logo.550232f1dbe993f37d8f8c2523a0e15705db7e87.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"the climate data factory","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Logiciels et Internet","sortDate":"2023-04-12","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/the-climate-data-factory/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"The Climate Data Factory","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"The Climate Data Factory met le HPC au Service de l’évaluation des risques liés au changement climatique avec le Cloud AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#france","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"France","description":"France","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:48+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-1