 Digital Front Door for healthcare is using the intelligent search features of Amazon Kendra to connect people with relevant, curated, and trusted information. The Digital Front Door provides a secure, open, and scalable platform that enables organizations to bring new and existing patient engagement technologies together into a unified, user-friendly hub. Amazon Kendra helps users to ask questions using natural language processing, giving quick and easy access to trusted answers to their health-related questions, drastically improving the current processes of finding information and ensuring people are getting the help they need, when they need it.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/orion-health-logo%401x.8cc08f33db64c131fcbf1924856cb3fbe8f0ff21.png","displayLocation":"New Zealand","customerNameLower":"orion health","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2023-04-07","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/orion-health-kendra-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Orion Health","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Orion Health Provides Healthcare Information Using Amazon Kendra","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kendra",