erations and administrations.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:24:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:24:41+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#lenme-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"lenme-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-04-12T22:52:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-20T22:26:17+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Explore how Lenme and AWS are revolutionizing lending with identity verification and subscriber authentication with Amazon Rekognition and AWS Identity Verification solutions. Lenme, a subscription-based service has revolutionized the lending industry by leveraging Amazon Web Services (AWS) to automate a platform that is now solving longstanding challenges of acquiring, verifying, and evaluating borrowers. With over 500,000 active users, Lenme connects individual borrowers with financial institutions, businesses, individual lenders, and data providers, to transfer service savings directly to users who have been traditionally underserved.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/lenme-logo%401x.d168e4422301b6290811190872407e7e4ce016d5.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"lenme","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2023-03-29","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/lenme-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Lenme","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Lenme Builds a Secure and Reliable Lending Platform Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Startup (SUP)","description":"Startup (SUP)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:16+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-s