zon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#migration-transfer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","description":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#cloud-operations","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Cloud Operations","description":"\u003cp\u003eAWS Cloud Operations provides a model and tools for a secure and efficient way to operate in the cloud. This is an initiative, not a product.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:05:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:05:06+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#business-resilience","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Business Resilience","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn business, resilience means dealing with adversity and shocks, and continuously adapting for growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:01:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:01:43+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#radix","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"radix","dateCreated":"2024-08-16T22:06:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-16T22:09:18+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"RDX Works Ltd. (RDX Works), a developer of the Radix decentralized ledger, is transforming the Web3 and decentralized finance (DeFi) user and developer experience with a “full stack” of tightly integrated layer 1 technologies accelerated by AWS tools and services. AWS has supported RDX Works in developing several products to help Web3 developers work faster and smarter in a secure, highly available environment.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/radix-logo%401x.ed3756fc46a9711d7aeed06d1c1b699f3ccbd6b7.jpg","displayLocation":"United Kingdom","customerNameLower":"radix dlt ltd.","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2023-03-06","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/radix/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Radix DLT Ltd.","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"AWS Supports Radix’s Fast, Secure, and Reliable Web3 Developer Experience","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description"