m/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#man-trucks-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"man-trucks-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-02-25T01:22:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-20T22:25:51+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Commercial vehicle manufacturer MAN Truck \u0026 Bus used features of Amazon EC2 to build a payment processing system that speeds up transactions in and around vehicles and helps optimize fleet management.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/man-truck-and-bus-logo%401x.d9a01520147ff0e2b73ba6bb24c80907a9d54772.png","displayLocation":"Germany","customerNameLower":"man truck \u0026 bus","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Automotive","sortDate":"2023-02-22","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/man-trucks-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"MAN Truck \u0026 Bus","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"MAN Truck \u0026 Bus Builds a Scalable Payment System Using Amazon EC2","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#germany","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Germany","description":"Germany","dateCreated":"202