"descriptionSummary":"Rackspace Technology used AWS Systems Manager to automate management of multicloud and hybrid infrastructures, saving hundreds of labor hours monthly, cutting costs, and reducing complexity.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/rackspace-technology-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"rackspace technology","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRackspace modernized its contact center using Amazon Connect, enabling it to easily optimize call flows without specialized engineering skills. Rackspace is one of the world\u0019s largest IT managed services providers. The company uses Amazon Connect as its contact center, Amazon Kinesis and Amazon Redshift for data ingestion and warehousing, and Amazon CloudWatch to monitor call characteristics.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2023-02-21","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/rackspace-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Rackspace Technology","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Rackspace Automates Infrastructure Management across Cloud Providers Using AWS Systems Manager"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#strategic","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Strategic","description":"Strategic","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-04-02T00:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020