ption":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#mwaa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Managed Workflows for Apache Airflow (MWAA)","description":"Amazon Managed Workflows for Apache Airflow (MWAA)","dateCreated":"2021-08-28T07:04:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:52+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Hospitality","description":"Hospitality","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#business-outcome#cost-optimization","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#business-outcome","name":"cost-optimization","description":"Cost Optimization","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2019-07-22T18:39:02+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Cost Management","description":"Cost Management","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-15T01:16:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#selectra-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"selectra-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-18T00:18:10+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eLeader de la comparaison en ligne des offres et des contrats d\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;nergie, Selectra passe \u0026agrave; la vitesse sup\u0026eacute;rieure en garantissant \u0026agrave; ses clients un niveau de service optimal et en offrant \u0026agrave; ses d\u0026eacute;veloppeurs une infrastructure parfaitement ma\u0026icirc;tris\u0026eacute;e et \u0026agrave; m\u0026ecirc;me de soutenir la croissance de l\u0026rsquo;entreprise. La souplesse de Kubernetes alli\u0026eacute;e \u0026agrave; la performance des services Amazon Web Services lui permet de d\u0026eacute;velopper de nouvelles lignes de service tout en soulageant ses \u0026eacute;quipes techniques de lourdes t\u0026acirc;ches de maintenance et de supervision.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","feature