t Territory (MMT)","description":"Mid-Market Territory (MMT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#johnson-and-johnson-ebs-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"johnson-and-johnson-ebs-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-03-29T23:32:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-20T22:26:16+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Johnson \u0026 Johnson (J\u0026J) needed a simple, low-cost solution to archive over 100K snapshots to meet compliance and legal regulations, with requirements for a retention period of 20+ years. J\u0026J chose Amazon EBS and EBS Snapshots Archive and migrated over 100K snapshots in 2 months. J\u0026J also integrated EBS Snapshots Archive into its discovery workflow to automate snapshot archive and recovery. As a result, J\u0026J archived petabytes of data with a projected annual savings of $1M, and it has been able to meet compliance requirements while reducing costs.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/johnson-and-johnson-logo%401x.cb5d9bdfef1782ba87eebf376fe8b863f73d618f.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"johnson \u0026 johnson","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2023-01-06","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/johnson-and-johnson-ebs-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Johnson \u0026 Johnson","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Johnson \u0026 Johnson Delivers Compliance at Scale Using Amazon EBS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","na