teCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T22:26:58+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eFond\u0026eacute;e en 1891, Philips est l\u0026#39;une des principales entreprises de technologies m\u0026eacute;dicales sp\u0026eacute;cialis\u0026eacute;e dans l\u0026#39;am\u0026eacute;lioration de la sant\u0026eacute; des personnes et l\u0026#39;obtention de meilleurs r\u0026eacute;sultats pour les patients. Ayant \u0026eacute;t\u0026eacute; l\u0026#39;une des premi\u0026egrave;res entreprises \u0026agrave; adopter Amazon Web Services (AWS), Philips s\u0026#39;appuie sur des dizaines de services AWS pour alimenter la plateforme HealthSuite de Philips. La plateforme aide les clients \u0026agrave; am\u0026eacute;liorer leur efficacit\u0026eacute; et la qualit\u0026eacute; de distribution gr\u0026acirc;ce \u0026agrave; des services tels que des connexions \u0026agrave; des dispositifs intelligents de niveau clinique, un cadre int\u0026eacute;gr\u0026eacute; permettant d\u0026#39;ing\u0026eacute;rer, de g\u0026eacute;rer et d\u0026#39;analyser les donn\u0026eacute;es relatives aux soins de sant\u0026eacute;, et bien plus encore. AWS offre \u0026agrave; Philips et \u0026agrave; ses clients des solutions \u0026eacute;volutives, \u0026eacute;conomique, r\u0026eacute;glementaires et conformes \u0026agrave; la loi HIPAA. Du cloud \u0026agrave; la p\u0026eacute;riph\u0026eacute;rie, Philips acc\u0026eacute;l\u0026egrave;re l\u0026#39;innovation, simplifie la s\u0026eacute;curit\u0026eacute; et la conformit\u0026eacute;, et augmente l\u0026#39;efficacit\u0026eacute; en proposant des solutions m\u0026eacute;dicales innovantes en cr\u0026eacute;ant sur AWS.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-customer-content/Lumify_with_Reacts_01-ALI-global.34b21dbd57d8d88715f9617b7ce396ccac615f78.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Innovators/philips-logo-innovator-page%401x.72da838390667ff0c4365725bd44e03a02030290.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"philips","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Santé","sortDate":"2023-01-03","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/philips/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Philips","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"Philips sur AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Database Migration","description":"Database Migration","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#general-database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"General Database Migration","description":"General Database Migration","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#france","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"France","description":"France","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:48+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#french","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"French","description":"French","dateCreated":"2020-03-0