\u0026rsquo;optimisation des co\u0026ucirc;ts. De plus, en utilisant les services g\u0026eacute;r\u0026eacute;s AWS, Snap \u0026eacute;conomise le temps de ses ing\u0026eacute;nieurs et d\u0026eacute;veloppeurs pass\u0026eacute; \u0026agrave; la maintenance et au provisionnement des ressources.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/emea-customer-references/emea-customer-images/NEW-Ad-Screenshot-Snapchat-AWS-is-How.7d48b4a7208a48dfa87589b4ed1be116c9e78873.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/emea-customer-references/emea-customer-images/NEW-Ad-Screenshot-Snapchat-AWS-is-How.7d48b4a7208a48dfa87589b4ed1be116c9e78873.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"snapchat","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Logiciels et Internet","sortDate":"2023-01-02","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/snapchat-aws-is-how/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Snapchat","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"« AWS Is How » : Snap offre une expérience fiable et très performante à des millions d’utilisateurs"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Migration","description":"Migration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#co