F Supply Chain China (SFDSC) is a leading supply chain service provider co-branded by SF and DHL, covering the Chinese Mainland, Hong Kong, and Macao. Headquartered in Shanghai, it has over 7,000 employees and offers high-caliber supply chain solutions to customers in the automotive, retailing, manufacturing and engineering, life science and health care, spare parts logistics, consumer goods, high technology, and transportation sectors. Over the past years, the company has been seeking to tap the synergy of technology, customer resources, transporting capacity, equipment, and infrastructure input, to equip customers with the integrated supply chain solutions empowered by the Internet, cloud computing, big data, and the Internet of Things (IoT).","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies-cards-imgs/sf-dhl-logox70.10a535e27c7884a589268f80840313e3c2aec5b3.png","displayLocation":"China","customerNameLower":"sf dsc case study","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Transport \u0026 Logistics","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://www.amazonaws.cn/en/customer-stories/sf-dsc-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"SF DSC Case Study","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"SF Supply Chain China Offers Smart Supply Chain Solutions on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","date