paceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Route 53","description":"Amazon Route 53","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#italy","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Italy","description":"Italy","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudfront","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudFront","description":"Amazon CloudFront","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#customer-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T23:37:45+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#italian","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Italian","description":"Italian","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:25+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sintad-case-study-from-es-directory","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sintad-case-study-from-es-directory","dateCreated":"2024-02-03T03:47:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-06T01:35:37+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Sintad desarrolla productos y software de negocios para empresas que están involucradas en el comercio exterior. Con el objetivo de salir de Perú y convertirse en potencia de software en Latinoamérica, la empresa decidió volverse un proveedor de Software as a Service (SaaS). Para eso, buscó a AWS.\nMario Castro Montenegro, Chief Product Officer de Sintad, recuerda que la empresa tenía un gran problema de soporte con los desarrollos previos. Según cuenta el ejecutivo, Sintad dedicaba 80% del tiempo en soporte y 20% en desarrollos de innovación y nuevos requerimientos. Con AWS, la compañía logró \"voltear la torta\", pasando la métrica para 30% a soporte y 70% a nuevos desarrollos. Al migrar para SaaS con el apoyo de servicios como Amazon Elastic Container Service, Amazon Relational Database Service y AWS Lambda, implementados de la mano con el partner Applying.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/Logo%20sintad%402x1.5f848f3f1868da888de291dd0f7c9ab5899a0ebd.png","displayLocation":"Perú","customerNameLower":"sintad","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Software e Internet","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/sintad-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Sintad","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Sintad pasa del 20% al 70% la métrica de tiempo dedicado a innovación"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elastic-container-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Container Service (ECS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Container Service (ECS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2020-02-13T00:27:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#peru","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Peru","description":"Peru","dateCreated":"2021-02-19T05:32:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#modyo-case-study-from-es-directory","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"modyo-case-study-from-es-directory","dateCreated":"2024-02-03T03:47:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-06T01:35:38+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Con un modelo de negocio basado en software como servicio (SaaS), Modyo necesitaba una infraestructura flexible. Cuando iniciaron la expansión internacional, vieron la necesidad de colocar esa infraestructura sobre algo que fuera más seguro y confiable: fueron a AWS. La relación evolucionó y Modyo se convirtió oficialmente en un partner de AWS.\nJosé Antonio Silva, CTO de Modyo, detalla esta historia de éxito en este video. El directivo también cuenta cuales son los principales servicios de nube que utilizan, inclusos AWS Aurora, Amazon ECS y Amazon CloudFront, para hacer una entrega global y segura, acuerdo con las mejores prácticas, de sus productos. Silva explica cómo la nube de AWS les entrega la tranquilidad para seguir evolucionando el negocio.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/modyo%402x.faa08f9eb3000944c9ae8c9f68f16c99fba49646.png","displayLocation":"Chile","customerNameLower":"modyo","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Software e Internet","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/modyo-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Modyo","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"AWS apoya el crecimiento internacional del proveedor de SaaS Modyo"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#chile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Chile","description":"Chile","dateCreated":"2020-07-02T22:30:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#clo