ntes ativos em 25 países.  Uma de suas principais soluções é a Topaz OFD, uma solução de proteção de ponta a ponta para as transações dos canais digitais através de um ecossistema completo, que analisa o risco em tempo real a partir de um banco de dados robusto e dinâmico, ampliando as possibilidades de negócios com agilidade através de uma tecnologia altamente integrável e escalável. A solução torna, também, a sociedade mais segura ao evitar perdas financeiras que seriam obtidas através de golpes que financiam criminosos e o narcotráfico.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/logo%20topaz%402x.195c82721f299dad1d337a6f93904ee04b0733a6.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","customerNameLower":"topaz","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Serviços financeiros","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/topaz-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Topaz","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"Com infraestrutura AWS, Topaz analisa mais de 2,8 bilhões de transações ao mês"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#portuguese","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Portuguese","description":"Portuguese","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Elastic Load Balancing (ELB)","description":"Elastic Load Balancing (ELB)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:34+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#brazil","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Brazil","description":"Brazil","dateCreated":"2020-04-20T18:05:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#prodequa-case-study-from-es-directory","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"prodequa-case-study-from-es-directory","dateCreated":"2024-02-03T03:47:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-06T01:35:37+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Prodequa se dedica a desarrollar ecommerce corporativo, software a medida para proyectos de larga duración e integración para ecommerce con distintos ERPs. La compañía necesitaba un buen hardware en la nube y también más disponibilidad y escalabilidad para soportar el incremento de sus proyectos.\nEn este video, Eduardo Alva, CEO de Prodequa, explica cómo la empresa implementó soluciones como Amazon Simple Storage Service, Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud, Amazon CloudWatch y Amazon LightSail, entre muchos otros, con el apoyo del Partner Applying. Además, afirma que con las herramientas brindadas por AWS Prodequa ha logrado reducir costos y tiempos de entregas de proyectos a una mayor cantidad de clientes a nivel nacional e internacional.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/prodequa%20logo%402x.ac3e36c4b706b81d806bcb57c7ae93e08e46296c.png","displayLocation":"Perú","customerNameLower":"prodequa","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Marketing digital","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/prodequa-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Prodequa","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Con AWS, Prodequa reduce costos y entrega servicios a una mayor cantidad de clientes"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"St