content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#tallysolutions","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"tallysolutions","dateCreated":"2023-05-11T00:15:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-21T00:20:53+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eTally Solutions uses AWS to provide reliable remote access to its integrated business application, onboard new users in 5\u0026ndash;10 minutes, and securely stream software to thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Tally_logo%401x.afeb6677dd8f8d2d249dfb5937ce96b7f4526481.png","displayLocation":"India","customerNameLower":"tally solutions","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/tallysolutions/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Tally Solutions","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Tally Solutions Securely Streams Its ERP Solution with NICE DCV","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#customer-e