ifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#accurait-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"accurait-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-09-01T00:09:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-21T00:20:54+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eSoftware provider Accurait uses artificial intelligence (AI) and machine learning (ML) to simplify lease management and document scanning. As customer demand for its AI-driven lease data extraction tool grew, Accurait migrated its tool\u0026rsquo;s underlying optical character recognition (OCR) software to AWS to improve performance, accuracy, and scalability.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Accurait_logo%401x.c70797986c7c9f36cf337148cb5dd64c24c01f22.png","displayLocation":"Australia","customerNameLower":"accurait","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.co