003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2025-02-06T21:12:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-02-06T21:13:04+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#swoop-aero-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"swoop-aero-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-05-19T23:53:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-20T22:25:53+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Swoop Aero deploys a fleet of drones into geographic areas and operates them as part of an integrated network. It uses a range of AWS services including AWS IoT Core and Amazon SageMaker, putting the company at the edge of aviation, transport, and automation. With AWS, Swoop Aero offers a scalable and safe service that leverages automation and ML to identify issues before aircraft take off.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/swoop-aero-logo%401x.ae0cecc260a8c04bd5a033dfc170373f1dc5ec9d.png","displayLocation":"Australia","customerNameLower":"swoop  aero","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Aerospace","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/swoop-aero-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Swoop  Aero","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Swoop Aero Deploys Aircraft Globally Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#australia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Australia","description":"Australia","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#iot-core","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS IoT Core","description":"AWS IoT Core","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32: