perator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#rumah-siap-kerja-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"rumah-siap-kerja-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-12-05T23:59:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-12-06T01:27:08+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Rumah Siap Kerja designed, built, and deployed a full-fledged Learning Management System in just 2 months using Amazon Web Services (AWS).","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Rumah_siapkerja_logo%401x.d099db378c4946e6af1852761021e4f015cfe975.png","displayLocation":"Indonesia","customerNameLower":"rumah siap kerja (rsk)","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2022-12-05","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/rumah-siap-kerja-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Rumah Siap Kerja (RSK)","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Rumah Siap Kerja Pivots to a Cloud-based E-Learning Platform in 2 Months on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Servi