SDIR-298\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAWS Skills Guild is a consultative engagement designed to inspire organization-wide cloud adoption and unlock innovation. It accelerates the cultural and technological shifts necessary for transformation by helping develop and launch a bespoke cloud enablement initiative using the AWS Skills Guild framework. Each engagement uses cloud excitement, skills application, and community development to layer formal education with hands-on training activities \u0026ndash; ultimately increasing cloud skill confidence and igniting a culture of continuous learning.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-05T23:40:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-05T23:40:01+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#ehealth-nsw-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"ehealth-nsw-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-12-05T23:59:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:34:44+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"From 2021 to 2022, eHealth NSW migrated 10 clinical applications, including mission critical workloads, from its on-premises infrastructure onto the AWS Cloud.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/government-new-south-wales-ehealth-nsw-logo%401x.6a790ee5634ddc304462c65056aff0556be22aef.png","displayLocation":"Australia","customerNameLower":"ehealth nsw","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"General Public Services","sortDate":"2022-12-05","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/ehealth-nsw-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"eHealth NSW","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"eHealth NSW Transforms Public Health System with the Cloud","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compli