is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#social-impact","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Social Impact","description":"\u003cp\u003eSocial impact means any significant or positive changes that solve or at least address social injustice and challenges. Businesses or organizations achieve these goals through conscious and deliberate efforts or activities in their operations and administrations.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:24:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:24:41+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#dci-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"dci-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-10-31T22:33:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-10-31T22:41:41+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Digital Commerce Intelligence (DCI) was founded in 2018 in Singapore and has offices in both Singapore and Greece. DCI provides businesses with intelligence on market trends, competition, and brand performance that allows them to plan corporate strategy based on data. As DCI grew, it was hindered by a lack of flexibility and high costs from its previous cloud provider. The company migrated to AWS in 6 months using the AWS Startup Program. The migration reduced its monthly cloud costs by 27 percent. DCI now has the tools and support it needs to achieve long-term success.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/dci-digital-commerce-intelligence-logo%401x.b64ce51eb9e0fcb2adf65a4f64d628258563ace5.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"digital commerce intelligence","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-10-31","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/dci-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Digital Commerce Intelligence","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"DCI Saves 27% on Cloud Costs, Gains Support for Long-Term Growth Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#cee","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Central \u0026 Eastern Europe","description":"Central \u0026 Eastern Europe","dateCreated":"2020-03-10T05:12:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Startup (SUP)","description":"Startup (SUP)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019