tory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#kepler-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"kepler-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-10-01T00:08:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:33+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Kepler Vision Technologies has built a hybrid solution on AWS, using video analysis to support the care and safety of elderly care home residents, cutting neural network image recognition training from weeks, to hours.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/kepler-vision-technologies-logo%401x.9e36aa9dfa84c36688edae4a4e62bf80b2879f89.png","displayLocation":"Netherlands","customerNameLower":"kepler vision technologies","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-09-30","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/kepler-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Kepler Vision Technologies","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Kepler Provides Effective Monitoring of Elderly Care Home Residents Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-catego