,"dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#batch","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Batch","description":"AWS Batch","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:19+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#goldman-sachs-data-video-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"goldman-sachs-data-video-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-04-12T22:45:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:59+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Over the last 150 years, New York-based Goldman Sachs has grown into a global investment banking, securities, and asset management organization that provides a wide range of financial services to clients including corporations, financial institutions, governments, and individuals. To meet the need for more efficient and scalable technology—including the ever-growing demand to find, procure, process, and use data from third-party parties—the company\u0027s leadership has mandated a migration to the cloud. Goldman Sachs’s Market Data division is executing on that vision and is supported by solutions such as Amazon Web Services (AWS) Data Exchange and FactSet to streamline its third-party data consumption.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/goldman-sachs-logo%401x.8c2922560041ff60da2c33ece0df53bbee330503.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"goldman sachs","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2022-09-09","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/goldman-sachs-data-video-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Goldman Sachs","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Goldman Sachs Streamlines Third-Party Data Consumption Using AWS Data Exchange and FactSet","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United States","description":"