ackup with its primary electronic healthcare records system to improve its recovery time by 97 percent.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/calverthealth-logo%401x.7159f3bc250e1cda7f4d7e40e7136736efbb6803.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"calverthealth","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2022-08-22","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/calverthealth-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"CalvertHealth","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"CalvertHealth Improves Electronic Health Records System Resilience and Shortens Recovery Time Using AWS Elastic Disaster Recovery","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United States","description":"United States","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#healthcare","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Healthcare","description":"Healthcare","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#drs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Elastic Disaster Recovery (DRS)","description":"AWS Elastic Disaster Recovery (DRS)","dateCreated":"2022-01-06T00:53:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#backup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Backup","description":"AWS Backup","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:19+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#salesforce-san-francisco-summit-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"salesforce-san-francisco-summit-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-08-22T23:23:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-03-02T02:48:47+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Salesforce is a cloud-based software company that provides customer relationship management services and a complementary suite of enterprise applications focused on customer service, marketing automation, analytics, and application development. In this video, Muralidhar Krishnaprasad, executive vice president (EVP) of engineering for Salesforce, describes how the company creates a single source of truth for customer data in the company\u0027s Customer Data Platform (CDP), utilizing AWS services such as Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS), Amazon DynamoDB, and Amazon EMR to provide marketers with a detailed view of their consumers and improve business outcomes.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/salesforce_Logo%401x.e3ea487b7f4ec96d760a1240c5b36f93823d1c54.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"salesforce","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Digital Marketing","sortDate":"2022-08-22","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/salesforce-san-francisco-summit-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Salesforce","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Salesforce Creates a Single Source of Data Truth for Its Customer Data Platform Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#digital-marketing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Digital Marketing","description":"Digital Marketing","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:42+0000