003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sony-interactive-entertainment-reinvent21-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sony-interactive-entertainment-reinvent21-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-08-22T23:23:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:50+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is a global leader in interactive and digital entertainment that is responsible for creating the world-renowned PlayStation brand and family of products. This session explores how SIE prepared for the launch of PlayStation 5 (PS5) against the backdrop of a global pandemic. Learn how SIE delivered PS5 without downtime to millions of players around the world using a coordinated-operations planned response program and a robust, scalable, and secure infrastructure using AWS services, including Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS), Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2), Amazon Route 53, and Amazon CloudWatch.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/sony-playstation-logo%401x.0960d0012cfb7f230e4c703786dec7201ae056f6.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"sony interactive entertainment (sie)","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2022-08-22","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/sony-interactive-entertainment-reinvent21-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE)","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Sony Interactive Entertainment Launches PlayStation 5 Without Downtime Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","descriptio