":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Cloud Financial Management","description":"Cloud Financial Management","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#healthcare","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Healthcare","description":"Healthcare","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2-spot-instances","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2 Spot Instances","description":"Amazon EC2 Spot Instances","dateCreated":"2022-04-26T06:27:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-04-26T06:27:16+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#rappi07072022linseflijaf","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"rappi07072022linseflijaf","dateCreated":"2023-02-08T01:17:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:37+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"In this episode of This Is My Architecture, you\u0027ll learn how the financial vertical of Rappi (Rappi Pay) offers Kubernetes as a service to more easily scale, increase performance, and improve security.  You\u0027ll see how they choose purpose-built AWS database and data caching services for different types of data within their solution. You\u0027ll also see how they leverage AWS CloudFront and AWS Direct Connect in a multi-tenant environment.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/rappi-logo%401x.e3f6d852f68b6a673150b380f45ac07e0a763a10.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"rappi","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Hospitality","sortDate":"2022-07-07","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/i4ueYgjVDCw?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Rappi","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Rappi: Leveraging EKS, DocumentDB, RDS and ElastiCache to Quickly Scale Kubernetes Clusters","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#documentdb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DocumentDB","d