erences#big-rocks","name":"AWS for Data","description":"\u003cp\u003eAWS for Data is a marketing \u0026ldquo;Big Rock\u0026rdquo; initiative that tells the story around how AWS can provide the most comprehensive set of data capabilities spanning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#thomson-reuters-aws-summit-toronto-2022","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"thomson-reuters-aws-summit-toronto-2022","dateCreated":"2024-03-09T00:29:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-28T22:18:59+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"In this video, Anu Dodda, Head of Engineering and CTO for Corporate Tax and Trade Technology at Thomson Reuters, describes how Thomson Reuters is working with AWS to acceerate application development, and implement a modern data strategy with services like Amazon Redshift, providing their customers with next generation reporting and analytics capabilities.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/ThomsonReuters-logo%401x.a2473994410678f2c11edc380b034f3cd53e8400.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"thomson reuters","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2022-07-01","headlineUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dWUnNVf84xNE\u0026did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Thomson Reuters","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"AWS Summit Toronto 2022 — Keynote Customer Speaker Thomson Reuters","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#data-lakes","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Data Lakes","description":"Data Lakes","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics",