:{"descriptionSummary":"In this episode of This is My Architecture, learn how Vertex Pharmaceuticals built a highly elastic, cost effective small molecule search platform using Serverless technologies. They democratized access to this system by making it available as an API using Amazon API Gateway, and the entire system comes alive in response to a request using AWS Lambda, AWS Fargate, and other technologies. To keep the system cost effective, Vertex made use of Fargate Spot for the search workers.\nLearn more about Vertex and explore career opportunities at vrtx.com","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Vertex_Logo%401x.409b3b5522c7002f8ba51cf9df3d35ead2cb7356.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"vertex pharmaceuticals incorporated","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2022-06-30","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/nflGdpwbf54?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Vertex Pharmaceuticals: A Serverless Platform for Small Molecule Search","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#mq","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon MQ","description":"Amazon MQ","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:51+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"