ency and improve customer experience.","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"nexthink s.a.","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-06-01","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/unF9tdYjqvU?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","customer-name":"Nexthink S.A.","headline":"Nexthink: Going Global with Amazon API Gateway, AWS Transit Gateway, AWS Lambda, and Amazon DynamoDB","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"}