 Hub","description":"\u003cp\u003eItems with this tag are being displayed in an Innovator-specific prefiltered Directory.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#outsystems05172022lknsefljasfseofih","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"outsystems05172022lknsefljasfseofih","dateCreated":"2023-02-08T01:16:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-02-08T01:38:42+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"In this episode of This Is My Architecture, you\u0027ll learn how OutSystems has decomposed their \"data monolith\" to allow them to more easily scale, increase performance, and improve security. You\u0027ll see how they choose purpose-built AWS database and data storage services for different types of data within their solution. You\u0027ll also learn how they leverage AWS Secrets Manager and AWS KMS to securely store data in a multi-tenant environment.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/outsystems-logo%401x.87683fe0763d3973919098685e2e758ec8d5cc45.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"outsystems - software em rede, s.a.","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-05-17","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/1kWxymroGeE?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"OUTSYSTEMS - SOFTWARE EM REDE, S.A.","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"OutSystems: Decomposing a Data Monolith for Scale and Multi-Tenancy","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#secrets-mgr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespac