rs of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#indivumed-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"indivumed-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-05-09T21:31:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-05-07T16:34:54+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Hamburg-based Indivumed specializes in using the highest quality biospecimen and comprehensive clinical data to advance research and development in precision oncology. Its IndivuType discovery solution uses AWS to store data and support analysis to decipher the complexity of cancer. By improving its AWS infrastructure, Indivumed has saved more than 50 percent on total IT costs and ramped up the number of samples it can process from 20 to 500 a week, a 2,400 percent increase.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/indivumed-logo%401x.f0492ec906682b8fac65fc1f3a53debe1878a8fc.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2022-05-09","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/indivumed-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","customer-name":"Indivumed","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Indivumed Boosts Cancer Research With Powerful Analytics Built on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBA