n with hands-on training activities \u0026ndash; ultimately increasing cloud skill confidence and igniting a culture of continuous learning.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-05T23:40:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-05T23:40:01+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#terminix-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"terminix-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-04-02T00:32:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-04-02T00:34:34+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"International pest control company Terminix strengthened its security posture using Gateway Load Balancer, reducing deployment times from days to minutes and achieving 99.999 percent availability.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/terminix-logo%401x.be59c884cca5f85bdd788cd6001178ac802857c0.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Professional Services","sortDate":"2022-04-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/terminix-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Terminix Accelerates Deployments from Days to Minutes, Achieves 99.999% Availability on AWS","customer-name":"Terminix"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references