isplay the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#volkswagen-financial-services-video-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"volkswagen-financial-services-video-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-04-23T05:59:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:59+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Volkswagen Financial Services (VWFS) is using Amazon Web Services (AWS) to drive cloud transformation across its organization. In this video, Osvaldo Ramirez, head of the North American region development hub, and Stefan Klünker, global product owner, describe how VWFS uses AWS Training and Certification to strengthen its employees’ cloud knowledge and skills.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/volkswagen-financial-services-logo%401x.e68eefdfea59f88f24cf6a63c65bdc4d1e892b14.png","displayLocation":"Germany","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2022-04-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/volkswagen-financial-services-video-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Volkswagen Financial Services AG","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Volkswagen Financial Services Uses AWS Training and Certification to Drive Cloud Transformation"}},"tags