mary":"As one province in Indonesia, Bali island is known for its tourism industry. Bali has eight regencies and one city called Denpasar as the provincial capital. Bali Provincial Government through its vision namely “Nangun Sat Kerthi Loka Bali” concerns maintaining the sanctity and harmony of Balinese nature and its contents about technology development to make Bali a smart island in Indonesia.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Bali_logo%401x.5bea64b143d810ce2c02f6d8f868b9fb2c7a1589.png","displayLocation":"Indonesia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"General Public Services","sortDate":"2022-03-23","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/bali-diskominfos-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Diskominfos Helps Bali Pursue Smart Island Digital Transformation on AWS","customer-name":"Communication, Information, and Statistics Agency of Bali (Diskominfos)"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#asean","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"ASEAN","description":"ASEAN","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T03:53:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#datacenter-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Datacenter Migration","description":"Datacenter Migration","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T04:21:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","loc