tural and technological shifts necessary for transformation by helping develop and launch a bespoke cloud enablement initiative using the AWS Skills Guild framework. Each engagement uses cloud excitement, skills application, and community development to layer formal education with hands-on training activities \u0026ndash; ultimately increasing cloud skill confidence and igniting a culture of continuous learning.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-05T23:40:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-05T23:40:01+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#pearson-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"pearson-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-10-25T22:40:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-05T23:54:21+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003ePearson put its value of lifelong learning into practice among its own employees, involving 2,000 technical and nontechnical personnel in AWS Training and improving solution performance as a result.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/pearson-logo%401x.3d48da03240be6fda73055c8c28858804f1504b0.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"pearson","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2022-01-10","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/pearson-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Pearson","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Pearson Upskills 2,000 Employees over 2 Years and Improves Solution Performance by Working with AWS Skills Guild","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","ta