azon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elastic-container-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Container Service (ECS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Container Service (ECS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2-spot-instances","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2 Spot Instances","description":"Amazon EC2 Spot Instances","dateCreated":"2022-04-26T06:27:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-04-26T06:27:16+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#servicio-cántabro-de-salud","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"servicio cántabro de salud","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:06:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:40+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eEl Servicio C\u0026aacute;ntabro de Salud est\u0026aacute; haciendo una migraci\u0026oacute;n completa a SAP para la compra unificada de material sanitario, cambiando de un modelo on-premise a uno en la nube. La participaci\u0026oacute;n del Servicio C\u0026aacute;ntabro de Salud en el Proyecto EHDEN (para el almacenamiento y compartici\u0026oacute;n de los historiales m\u0026eacute;dicos) y del Proyecto CA\u0026Ntilde;IA (que emplea servicios de Inteligencia Artificial para reconocer el resultado de las pruebas Covid) tambi\u0026eacute;n han sido posible gracias a las tecnolog\u0026iacute;as de AWS.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","displayLocation":"España","customerNameLower":"servicio cántabro de salud","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Public Sector","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/servicio-cantabro-de-salud/?sc_channel\u003dsm\u0026sc_campaign\u003dYouTube_Videos\u0026sc_publisher\u003dTWITTER\u0026sc_country\u003demea\u0026sc_geo\u003dEMEA\u0026sc_outcome\u003dawareness\u0026trkCampaign\u003des22_casestudy_serviciocantrabodesalud\u0026sc_content\u003dimage\u0026did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card-sm_es22_casestudy_serviciocantrabodesalud","customer-name":"Servicio Cántabro de Salud","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"El Servicio Cántabro de Salud mejora su servicio al ciudadano con AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#spain","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Spain","description":"Spain","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#iberia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Iberia","description":"Iberia","dateCreated":"2020-04-09T03:37:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#universidad-andres-bello","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"universidad-andres-bello","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:04:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:42+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"La Universidad Andrés Bello es una universidad privada chilena creada en 1988. Desde 2020, pertenece a la Fundación Educación y Cultura. Es una de las cuatro universidades chilenas que figuran en el Academic Ranking of World Universities, adjudicándose el lugar 4. El desafío que enfrentan y en el cual están trabajando es la transformación digital de la institución, que posibilite la automatización de varios de sus procesos y poner a disposición de sus cerca de 60 mil estudiantes, las herramientas tecnológicas que les ayuden a llevar a buen puerto (y con gran velocidad) sus investigaciones y la obtención de nuevas habilidades para su vida profesional futura. Es decir, a mejorar la experiencia de los estudiantes y potenciar la investigación al interior de la universidad.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/industry-images-customer-references/higher-ed-students.7b60dabacba659c986a7ec8dc61c3032e77b3362.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/universidad-andres-bello-logo%402x.22b778414817944a247ee4662f655f5f1aa111be.png","displayLocation":"Chile","customerNameLower":"univ. andres bello","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Educación","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/universidad-andres-bello/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Univ. Andres Bello","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Estudiantes e investigadores mejor preparados para el futuro a través de AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Migration","description":"Migration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudfront","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudFront","description":"Amazon CloudFront","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#datacenter-migration","locale":"en_US","tagN