ame":"AWS Marketplace","description":"AWS Marketplace","dateCreated":"2020-12-02T20:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:50+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United States","description":"United States","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#innovator#moderna","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Moderna Therapeutics","description":"Moderna Therapeutics","dateCreated":"2022-04-25T19:06:29+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-09-15T00:48:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#series#aws-reinvent","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#series","name":"AWS re:Invent","description":"AWS re:Invent","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:36:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#innovator","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Innovator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#itau-c4m","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"itau-c4m","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:06:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T00:24:48+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"O Itaú Unibanco vem investindo na modernização de sua plataforma tecnológica para incrementar os níveis de atração, retenção e engajamento de seus Clientes. Particularmente, a equipe de Cloud for Marketing busca entender melhor o comportamento deste Cliente quando está fora do ambiente Itaú, para oferecer produtos e serviços que façam sentido para seu momento de vida.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/itau-logo%402x.cc96e60df104954c8960737a54830d300847fb5a.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","customerNameLower":"itaú","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Serviços financeiros","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/itau-c4m/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Itaú","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"Itaú Unibanco acelera em 10x a análise de dados para ações de marketing com AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sagemaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon SageMaker","description":"Amazon SageMaker","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:1