"AI \u0026 ML","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:30:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:54+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2020-02-13T00:27:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:26+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#big-rocks#aws-for-data","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#big-rocks","name":"AWS for Data","description":"\u003cp\u003eAWS for Data is a marketing \u0026ldquo;Big Rock\u0026rdquo; initiative that tells the story around how AWS can provide the most comprehensive set of data capabilities spanning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#pinterest-proserve","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"pinterest-proserve","dateCreated":"2022-10-18T21:00:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-03-02T02:48:47+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Pinterest is a visual-discovery platform and social commerce network with a mission to inspire. Building on AWS storage and compute solutions, Pinterest uses sophisticated machine learning engines to deliver personalized content to its users.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Pinterest_Customer-Reference_Logo.2b8b17653ab4b4b98c4b9534e8832cf12692e2c9.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"pinterest","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Digital Marketing","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/pinterest-proserve/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Pinterest","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"How Pinterest Engaged with AWS Proserve to Ensure Pinners have Always-On Access to their Platform","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#innovator","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Innovator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","