me":"Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling","description":"Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector-govt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Government","description":"Government","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-19T00:18:44+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#davivienda-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"davivienda-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-06-27T20:44:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:40+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"El Banco Davivienda (Davivienda), una entidad bancaria con sede en Colombia, fiel a su política de talento humano que busca desarrollar el máximo potencial de sus colaboradores y ofrecerles oportunidades de crecimiento, decidió apoyar al personal que trabaja a distancia al proporcionarles las herramientas que necesitan para realizar sus labores diarias desde casa. Aunque parte del personal ya había comenzado a trabajar a distancia, el banco tuvo que configurar una red privada virtual (VPN) para instalar nuevas estaciones de trabajo y establecer una conexión segura con los sistemas bancarios de Davivienda. Este proceso podía tardar hasta tres días en completarse y, en muchos casos, requería que el banco transportara el hardware de apoyo y otros activos fuera de las instalaciones.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/IMG_2488.f0d905de5bbd6534d402b456deb5ea21da21686a.jpeg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/NM%20DaviviendaLogoV1.04b25f5fc989b2f99d3af28f52db3ecee116ceb7.png","displayLocation":"Colombia","customerNameLower":"davivienda","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/davivienda-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Davivienda","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"El Banco Davivienda adopta un modelo de lugar de trabajo híbrido mediante Amazon WorkSpaces"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#directory-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Directory Service","description":"AWS Directory Service","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#euc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"End-User Computing (EUC)","description":"End-User Computing (EUC)","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#colombia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Colombia","description":"Colombia","dateCreated":"2020-07-02T22:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#systems-mgr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Systems Manager","description":"AWS Systems Manager","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudwatch","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudWatch","description":"Amazon CloudWatch","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#workspaces","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon WorkSpaces","description":"Amazon WorkSpaces","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:08+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#remote-work-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Remote Work \u0026 Learning","description":"Remote Work \u0026 Learning","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:26:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:55+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#remote-work-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Remote Work \u0026 Learning","description":"Remote Work \u0026 Learning","dateCreated":"2020-08-31T22:04:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:42:25+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#euc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"End-User Computing (EUC)","description":"End-User Computing (EUC)","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-03T00:20:21+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#quasar","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"quasar","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:06:29+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:46+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Criada em 2019, a Quasar é uma consultoria especializada no desenvolvimento de softwares de gestão pública. No início de 2021, a empresa fechou um grande contrato com o governo de Minas Gerais, que representou crescimento e, ao mesmo tempo, o desafio de adequar seus preços para que pudesse levar suas soluções a municípios com até 20 mil habitantes. Com o apoio da AWS, a Quasar conseguiu redesenhar sua arquitetura, reduzindo seus custos em 90% e deixando-a pronta para atender este novo público.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/awsmp/solutions/security/rsinstititeu_cloudimage.20c280149af28044b9fdc570ce88f534e828a103.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/quasar_logo%402x.cd3754713ac6806a4230a2ab5230445c1c3eade3.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","customerNameLower":"quasar","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Serviços públicos gerais","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/quasar/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Quasar","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"Estrutura em nuvem AWS permite à Quasar levar serviços a pequenos municípios"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ses","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Email Service (SES)","description":"Amazon Simple Email Service (SES)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ecr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Container Registry (ECR)","description":"Amazon Elastic Container Registry (ECR)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T0