e uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#arcos-dorados","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"arcos-dorados","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:38+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Arcos Dorados es la franquicia más grande del mundo de la marca McDonald\u0027s, operando 20 países o territorios en América Latina. Hace unos años, la compañía empezó un proceso de transformación digital con el reto de darle a los clientes un servicio con mayor conveniencia y con relación cada vez más personalizada. En este video, Magdalena González Victorica, Chief Technology Officer de Arcos Dorados, cuenta cómo la empresa utilizó las soluciones y los servicios profesionales de AWS y del partner Econocomdigital. Arcos Dorados implementó la infraestructura para tener la información y poder conectarse con los clientes de manera mucho más cercana y humana, aumentando sus ventas y evolucionando como compañía desde el punto de vista digital y de datos.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/arcos_dorados_logo%402x.ee2c34cb96a3b213a1c51d912a70698cd3e0818a.png","displayLocation":"Argentina","customerNameLower":"arcos dorados","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Hostelería","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/arcos-dorados/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Arcos Dorados","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Cómo Arcos Dorados utiliza servicios AWS para evolucionar desde el punto de vista digital"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"AI \u0026 ML","description":"AI \u0026 ML","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:30:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:54+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#emr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EMR","description":"Amazon EMR","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+